Important boundaries
- Reminders appear only while the app is running. They persist to data/reminders.json, so the next launch can detect overdue reminders.
- Email drafting invokes the computer's default email application; it does not access inboxes or send mail automatically.
- Google lookup opens a search results page; ChatGPT opens its website.
- Optional direct AI answers need an OpenAI API key and may incur usage charges.
- No microphone, desktop-control permissions, or system-wide automation is implemented in this starter.
Future enhancements
- System tray and OS notifications for background reminders
- OAuth-based Gmail integration with explicit scopes and confirmation before sending
- Voice recognition, multilingual speech and customizable character sprites
- Command parser for safe desktop actions with permission boundaries
- Packaging as a Windows executable using PyInstaller
